---
description: Do not hardcode the consumer global-packages prefix in shared packages/dev-tools files
globs: "**/packages/dev-tools/**,**/packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared dev-tools paths

Glob-gated. Files that **live in** `packages/dev-tools/` must work in both checkouts. Full rule: `packages/dev-tools/ai/workflows/dev-tools-paths.md` (consumers: prefix `packages/global-packages/`).

Do **not** hardcode `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/` as the only path in shared scripts, actions, or agent docs.

- Origin: `packages/dev-tools/…`
- Consumer: `packages/global-packages/packages/dev-tools/…`

Resolve with a path relative to the current file, `github/scripts/lib/resolve-dev-tools-root.sh`, or `BLOCKERA_DEV_TOOLS_ROOT`.

Exceptions: product-root `root-configs/` copies; README **examples** of consumer workflows; the product’s own `.github/workflows/`.
